                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="p-3">Above 7,000,000</td>
                            <td class="p-3"
                                >PKR 1,424,000 + 35% of amount exceeding
                                7,000,000</td
                            >
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <p class="mt-4">
                <strong>Note:</strong> The 9% surcharge on salaried individuals has
                been abolished for Tax Year 2027. Your tax is simply the slab calculation.
            </p>

